# ast-of on literal expression returns AST dict of the literal
[include %rust "meta"]
[ast-of 42]
=== out
Variant(Literal, Dict({"kind": String("int"), "value": Int(42), "span": Dict({"start": Dict({"line": Int(2), "col": Int(9), "offset": Int(31)}), "end": Dict({"line": Int(2), "col": Int(11), "offset": Int(33)})})}))
=== warn
undefined variable: ast-of at 2:2-2:8
